 support of AI and data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/06/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q2","e":"fcel","d":"2025-06-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"Along with our earnings announcement this morning, FuelCell Energy announced a restructuring plan that prioritizes sales of our molten carbonate platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/06/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q2","e":"fcel","d":"2025-06-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"Additionally, as I this effort, we are taking meaningful steps to rightsize our business, manage expenses, and position ourselves to take advantage of near-term opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/06/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q4","e":"fcel","d":"2025-12-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"As you all know, demand for power is accelerating quickly, driven by the exponential growth of AI, data centers, and digital infrastructure that is outpacing the capabilities of the existing grid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q4","e":"fcel","d":"2025-12-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"AI-driven demand is reshaping power requirements across the data center and digital infrastructure ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q4","e":"fcel","d":"2025-12-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"Starting around twelve months ago, we began a series of thoughtful restructuring measures to sharpen our focus and strengthen the fundamentals of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2025 Q4","e":"fcel","d":"2025-12-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"Through this series of tough decisions to streamline and focus our organization, today, we are operating with greater discipline, lower cost, and strategic clarity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q1","e":"fcel","d":"2026-03-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Few","x":"The explosive growth of AI, digital infrastructure, and compute-intensive workloads collides with a power system that cannot scale quickly enough.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q1","e":"fcel","d":"2026-03-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Few","x":"DC-native power backbone aligns perfectly with the requirements of AI and high-density compute workloads, eliminating inefficient AC-to-DC conversions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q1","e":"fcel","d":"2026-03-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Bishop","x":"…$27.6 million in 2025, primarily due to a $4.1 million decrease in research and development expenses, a decrease of $1.5 million in administrative and selling expenses, and the lack of any restructuring expense recorded in 2026 compared to $1.5 million of restructuring expenses included in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q2","e":"fcel","d":"2026-06-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"AI, digital infrastructure, and high density compute are driving a step change in power demand, while grid timelines remain too slow to meet that need.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/08/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q2","e":"fcel","d":"2026-06-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Few","x":"And our focus on the AI and data center market, The unprecedented power density requirements of AI infrastructure have exposed the severe limitations of the traditional grid creating an immediate need for reliable, behind the meter baseload generation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/08/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q2","e":"fcel","d":"2026-06-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Bishop","x":"This 12% year over year improvement in adjusted EBITDA reflects our progress on cost reduction and operating efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/08/fuelcell-fcel-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q3","e":"fcel","d":"2026-09-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Few","x":"We believe distributed generation will become an essential layer of AI infrastructure, enabling the grid to expand while allowing AI factories to deploy on commercial timelines rather than utility timelines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q3","e":"fcel","d":"2026-09-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Few","x":"…our utility-scale distributed generation platform is uniquely positioned to help accelerate AI infrastructure by reducing time to power, extending the existing electric grid with reliable behind-the-meter generation, and addressing many of the permitting and community challenges associated…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q3","e":"fcel","d":"2026-09-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Bishop","x":"That improvement was primarily driven by the absence of the asset impairment and restructuring charges that heavily impacted the prior year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FCEL 2026 Q3","e":"fcel","d":"2026-09-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Bishop","x":"This year-over-year reduction in operating expenses was primarily driven by the absence of $68.5 million of asset impairment and restructuring charges incurred during the third quarter of fiscal 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/fuelcell-energy-fcel-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"cinema":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"imax":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"streaming":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"dtc":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"ai_spend":[[61,1,5551,2,1,1,4600,430],[63,1,7418,2,2,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,5,0,5,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,6,6,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,4,0,4,180,6616]],"tariffs":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"pricing_power":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,0,0,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,0,0,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,0,0,0,180,6616]],"cost_cuts":[[61,1,5551,18,17,1,4600,430],[63,1,7418,10,10,0,4479,2695],[64,1,6710,2,2,0,1659,4752],[65,1,5556,1,1,0,5150,0],[66,1,7063,7,0,7,180,6616]],"guidance":[[61,1,5551,0,0,0,4600,430],[63,1,7418,0,0,0,4479,2